The probes confirmed that the collapsed rail’s destination buttons have empty accessible names, Tab can leave the top modal for background controls, and Escape from the tenant list drops focus to the document body.

The native driver also needs fixes: its toast check locks the credential store, while the preference writes to a separate file store; its two zoom steps reach 120%, not the claimed 200%.
